vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span>; <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>f</mi><mo>:</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>→</mo><mi>B</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>↦</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[f: A \\to B]  \\mapsto {\\mathrm{ker}}(f)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">↦</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">ker</span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span>,</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>I hadn’t seen above that <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>→</mo><mi>B</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>↦</mo><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[A \\to B] \\mapsto A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">↦</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span> is a dependent sum map, so we see the positive and negative polarities of the <a href=\"https://ncatlab.org/nlab/show/dependent%20sum%20type\">dependent sum type</a> via the adjunctions on each side.</p>\n<p>And, as suggested in <a href=\"#narrow/channel/15-Mathematics.2C-Physics-.26-Philosophy/topic/Musings.20on.20modalities/near/57249\">#1</a>, we did <a href=\"https://ncatlab.org/nlab/show/Sierpinski%20topos#DifferentialCohesion\">observe</a> that a form of reduction modality appears.</p>","timestamp":1640596154,"subject":"Musings on modalities","stream_id":15,"display_recipient":"Mathematics, Physics & Philosophy","reactions":[]},{"id":95941,"sender_id":25,"sender_full_name":"David_Corfield","avatar_url":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/7d52fbe20c8ac05886a296e9ee2159b1?d=identicon&version=1","content":"<p><a href=\"#narrow/channel/15-Mathematics.2C-Physics-.26-Philosophy/topic/Musings.20on.20modalities/near/95941\">#8</a> Re <a href=\"#narrow/channel/15-Mathematics.2C-Physics-.26-Philosophy/topic/Musings.20on.20modalities/near/95781\">#7</a>, with cartesian product as a (nondependent) dependent sum, we might expect the third adjoint, <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>→</mo><mi>B</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>↦</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[A \\to B]  \\mapsto B</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">↦</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span>, to have something to do with coproduct. </p>\n<p>I guess it does, since we can see</p>\n<p><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi mathvariant=\"script\">C</mi><mrow><mtext> </mtext><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo><mover><mo><mo><mover><mo><mo><mover><mo><mo>⟶</mo></mo><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">×</mo></mover></mo></mo><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\"><mover><mo><mo>⟵</mo></mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi></mover></mo></mover></mo></mo><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\"><mover><mo><mo>⟶</mo></mo><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">+</mo></mover></mo></mover></mo><mi mathvariant=\"script\">C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\n\\mathcal{C}^{\\,2}\n\\stackrel{\\stackrel{+}{\\longrightarrow}}{\\stackrel{\\stackrel{\\Delta}{\\longleftarrow}}{\\stackrel{\\times}{\\longrightarrow}}}\n  \\mathcal{C}\n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.6593em;vertical-align:-0.011em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathcal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0583em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mspace mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1952em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\"><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.6483em;\"><span style=\"top:-4.4588em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.4588em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mrel\"><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.4588em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.2193em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.2193em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mrel\"><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2193em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop\">⟶</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.711em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">×</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.011em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.6387em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.2193em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mrel mtight\"><span class=\"mop op-limits mtight\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3421em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.7em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop mtight\">⟵</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.411em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">Δ</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.011em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist